WEBVTT

00:40:57.624 --> 00:41:02.798
You know, it completes me
in a very intense and profound way.

00:41:02.822 --> 00:41:04.105
CA: Talk about that a bit.

00:41:04.129 --> 00:41:06.005
I mean, you're married to an extrovert.

00:41:06.029 --> 00:41:08.465
How do you manage your social life?

00:41:08.489 --> 00:41:10.242
SC: Oh, well, you know, it's funny,

00:41:10.266 --> 00:41:13.763
because that particular area
is probably our easiest.

00:41:13.787 --> 00:41:16.464
But even there,
we definitely have differences.

00:41:16.488 --> 00:41:21.286
My husband would love
to be having guests over all the time.

00:41:21.310 --> 00:41:25.572
And I like it when we have guests,
but I like to really space it out.

00:41:25.596 --> 00:41:29.251
I bear the responsibility
of hosting really heavily.

00:41:29.275 --> 00:41:32.484
So, it's not something
I can just do lightly,